EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Do you have any fun summer plans,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}} I want to go swimming
every day and climb lots of trees!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¿Tienes algún plan para el verano,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}} ¡Yo pienso ir tooodos
los días a nadar y a trepar árboles!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Yaz için eğlenceli planların var mı,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}} Ben her gün yüzmek ve bol bol
ağaca tırmanmak istiyorum!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}En esta estación,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} los bichines y las
plantas campan felices a sus anchas.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡El pueblo está lleno de vida!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Tout le monde adore l'été, même
les plantes et les petites bébêtes !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
La ville est en ébullition !

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Insekten und Pflanzen scheinen
diese Jahreszeit auch zu mögen.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Die ganze Stadt summt und sirrt!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Today is a dangerous day to read.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
If you're not careful,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} you could stay
up reading into the wee hours!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Mal día para leer, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}bichín.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ten cuidado y cógete algo aburrido,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
¡o se te pasará la hora de acostarte!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Adoooro leggere le mie riviste{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
e visto che oggi non farà mai buio,
avrò un sacco di luce per farlo!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Bugün kitap okumak tehlikeli.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Dikkat etmezsen,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} farkına varmadan sabahın
ilk ışıklarına kadar okuyabilirsin!
